<title>USA: Unidigital Inc Aug 31 full-year results.</title>
<headline>Unidigital Inc Aug 31 full-year results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>STATEMENT OF OPERATIONS		     12 Months Ended</p>
<p>						   8/31/96    8/31/95</p>
<p>Net sales				   $11,659,818   $8,542,020</p>
<p>Income before income taxes		1,894,268    1,499,673</p>
<p>Income taxes				  1,064,327	356,000</p>
<p>NET INCOME					829,941    1,143,673</p>
<p>PRO FORMA INCOME DATA</p>
<p>Pro forma income before income taxes  1,967,037	 (a)</p>
<p>Pro forma income taxes			794,616	 (b)</p>
<p>Pro forma net income			1,172,421</p>
<p>EARNINGS OR (LOSS) PER SHARE</p>
<p>Historical earnings per share		  $0.31	 $0.57</p>
<p>Pro forma earnings per share		   $0.44</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding    2,643,828    2,000,000</p>
<p>Notes:</p>
<p>(a) Pro forma adjustment reflects implementation of employment agreements.</p>
<p>(b) Adjusted for non-recurring tax charge upon conversion from Subchapter S Corporation status to Subchapter C Corporation status.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
